      "summary": {
        "unit_id": "scripts/mp_common/gametypes/dev.gsc::getormakebot",
        "behavior": "Dev bot-finder/creator helper: scans level.players for a player on the requested team with isbot() true and returns it; otherwise bot::add_bot(team); if defined, plays sound marker x617 on players and waits 1; returns the bot entity. HMH-path limit: the function body and all recorded callers are dev-delimited. Pointer store level.devongetormakebot=&getormakebot happens only inside the dev block of the NON-dev dev.gsc __init__ (51-53); dev system registration itself is dev-delimited (autoexec 35-38). Inbound edges: four in-file dev callers (updatehardpoints 191, addenemyheli 1755, addtestcarepackage 1845, force_grenade_throw 2832), mp rat rscaddenemy:66 dev::getormakebot(team), and two dev dvar-poll field-dispatch consumers (killstreak_hacking::killstreak_switch_team 232-234 gated on isdefined(level.devongetormakebot), weaponobjects::switch_team 3787-3789 same pattern). The observed point [excerpt; exact source record identified separately]",
        "unknowns": [
          "Whether dev-delimited dev.gsc content exists in the original PS4 script VMs for any VM that HMH loads (exact original-build evidence still needed)",
          "Recovered source importer is globallogic.gsc81 #using scripts/mp_common/rat, reached in the Warzone source closure through warzone.gsc30. Actual original VM loading/execution remains unproved.",
          "on_start_gametype / on_connect native dispatch timing",
          "bot::add_bot contract (m1 scope) and sound marker x617"
        ],
        "status": "complete_bounded_contract"
      },
